#: ../../source/platform/index.rst:2
msgid "Platform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/platform/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache is device-neutral and supports mainstream accelerator hardware. "
"The platform layer detects the active device backend and provides the "
"device-specific operations used by LMCache without tying the rest of "
"LMCache to a single hardware vendor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/platform/index.rst:9
msgid "Device backends are provided in two ways:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/platform/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Built-in backends** are maintained in the LMCache repository and "
"released with LMCache."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/platform/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Device plugins** are vendor-maintained Python packages installed "
"alongside LMCache. They register a backend through the "
"``lmcache.device_plugins`` entry-point group and can follow an "
"independent release cycle."
msgstr ""

