msgid "Replace ``foo`` with the plugin's registered backend name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/platform/index.rst:73
msgid ""
"Only install plugins from trusted sources because entry-point packages "
"execute Python code when the platform registry initializes. Device "
"vendors and backend developers can follow :doc:`Adding a New Device "
"Backend "
"<../developer_guide/extending_lmcache/adding_a_new_device_backend>` to "
"implement and package a plugin."
